                        <p class="mt-5 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-navy-800">UGC NET Paper-1 ka Unit-8 — ICT
                            (Information &amp; Communication Technology) — ek aisa unit hai jahan facts aur concepts ka
                            mix hota hai. Yahan aapko computer fundamentals, internet, digital initiatives aur
                            e-governance jaise topics se direct MCQ bante hain. Jo candidates is unit ko ignore karte
                            hain, wahi final merit mein peeche reh jaate hain.</p>
                        <p class="mt-5 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-navy-800">Is complete Unit-8 guide mein hum
                            cover kar rahe hain: pura syllabus, computer basics, digital initiatives, e-governance,
                            ICT terminology aur exam pattern — taaki aap December 2026 exam mein is unit se full marks
                            laa sakein.</p>

