                        <div id="e-governance" class="card mt-5 scroll-mt-28 p-6 sm:p-7">
                            <div class="flex items-center gap-3.5"><span
                                    class="grid h-10 w-10 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-gold-400 font-display text-[16px] font-extrabold text-navy-950">05</span>
                                <h2 class="text-[20px] font-extrabold leading-snug text-navy-900">E-Governance &amp;
                                    Cyber Security</h2>
                            </div>
                            <p class="mt-4 text-[14.5px] leading-relaxed text-navy-800">E-Governance aur Cyber Security
                                se 1–2 questions aate hain. Yeh key points yaad karo:</p>
                            <div class="mt-5 grid gap-4 lg:grid-cols-2">
                                <div class="relative rounded-2xl border border-navy-900/10 bg-navy-50 p-5">
                                    <p class="text-[15.5px] font-extrabold text-navy-900">E-Governance Models</p>
                                    <ul class="mt-3.5 grid gap-2">
                                        <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[13.5px] leading-relaxed text-navy-800">
                                            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                                                class="mt-0.5 h-3.5 w-3.5 shrink-0 text-emerald-600" fill="none"
                                                stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round"
                                                stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                                                <path d="m5 12.5 4.5 4.5L19 7" />
                                            </svg>G2C — Government to Citizen</li>
                                        <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[13.5px] leading-relaxed text-navy-800">
                                            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                                                class="mt-0.5 h-3.5 w-3.5 shrink-0 text-emerald-600" fill="none"
                                                stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round"
                                                stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                                                <path d="m5 12.5 4.5 4.5L19 7" />
                                            </svg>G2B — Government to Business</li>
                                        <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[13.5px] leading-relaxed text-navy-800">
                                            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                                                class="mt-0.5 h-3.5 w-3.5 shrink-0 text-emerald-600" fill="none"
                                                stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round"
                                                stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                                                <path d="m5 12.5 4.5 4.5L19 7" />
                                            </svg>G2G — Government to Government</li>
                                        <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[13.5px] leading-relaxed text-navy-800">
                                            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                                                class="mt-0.5 h-3.5 w-3.5 shrink-0 text-emerald-600" fill="none"
                                                stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round"
                                                stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                                                <path d="m5 12.5 4.5 4.5L19 7" />
                                            </svg>G2E — Government to Employee</li>
                                    </ul>
                                </div>
                                <div class="relative rounded-2xl border border-navy-900/10 bg-navy-50 p-5">
                                    <p class="text-[15.5px] font-extrabold text-navy-900">Cyber Security Basics</p>
                                    <ul class="mt-3.5 grid gap-2">
                                        <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[13.5px] leading-relaxed text-navy-800">
                                            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                                                class="mt-0.5 h-3.5 w-3.5 shrink-0 text-emerald-600" fill="none"
                                                stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round"
                                                stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                                                <path d="m5 12.5 4.5 4.5L19 7" />
                                            </svg>Malware, Virus, Trojan, Worm</li>
                                        <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[13.5px] leading-relaxed text-navy-800">
                                            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                                                class="mt-0.5 h-3.5 w-3.5 shrink-0 text-emerald-600" fill="none"
                                                stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round"
                                                stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                                                <path d="m5 12.5 4.5 4.5L19 7" />
                                            </svg>Phishing, Spoofing, Hacking</li>
                                        <li class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[13.5px] leading-relaxed text-navy-800">
                                            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                                                class="mt-0.5 h-3.5 w-3.5 shrink-0 text-emerald-600" fill="none"
                                                stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round"
                                                stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                                                <path d="m5 12.5 4.5 4.5L19 7" />
                                            </svg>Firewall, Antivirus, Encryption</li>
                                    </ul>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div id="exam-pattern" class="card mt-5 scroll-mt-28 p-6 sm:p-7">
                            <div class="flex items-center gap-3.5"><span
                                    class="grid h-10 w-10 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-gold-400 font-display text-[16px] font-extrabold text-navy-950">06</span>
                                <h2 class="text-[20px] font-extrabold leading-snug text-navy-900">Exam Pattern &amp;
                                    Weightage</h2>
                            </div>
                            <p class="mt-4 text-[14.5px] leading-relaxed text-navy-800">ICT Unit-8 se consistently 4–5
                                questions aate hain. Har question 2 marks ka hota hai, negative marking nahi hai — yeh
                                unit aapke score ko directly boost karta hai.</p>
                            <div class="mt-5 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
                                <div class="rounded-xl border border-navy-900/10 bg-navy-50 px-4 py-3.5">
                                    <p
                                        class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[11px] font-extrabold uppercase tracking-wider text-navy-500">
                                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="h-3.5 w-3.5 text-gold-600" fill="none"
                                            stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round"
                                            stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                                            <rect x="5" y="4.5" width="14" height="16" rx="2.5" />
                                            <path d="M9 4.5a3 3 0 0 1 6 0" />
                                            <path d="M9 11h6M9 15h4" />
                                        </svg>Questions</p>
                                    <p class="mt-1.5 text-[14.5px] font-extrabold leading-snug text-navy-900">4–5 per
                                        paper</p>
                                </div>
                                <div class="rounded-xl border border-navy-900/10 bg-navy-50 px-4 py-3.5">
                                    <p
                                        class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[11px] font-extrabold uppercase tracking-wider text-navy-500">
                                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="h-3.5 w-3.5 text-gold-600" fill="none"
                                            stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round"
                                            stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                                            <path d="M7 4h10v5a5 5 0 0 1-10 0V4Z" />
                                            <path d="M7 5.5H4.5V7a3 3 0 0 0 3 3M17 5.5h2.5V7a3 3 0 0 1-3 3" />
                                            <path d="M12 14v4M8.5 21h7l-.7-3h-5.6l-.7 3Z" />
                                        </svg>Marks</p>
                                    <p class="mt-1.5 text-[14.5px] font-extrabold leading-snug text-navy-900">8–10
                                        marks</p>
                                </div>
                                <div class="rounded-xl border border-navy-900/10 bg-navy-50 px-4 py-3.5">
                                    <p
                                        class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[11px] font-extrabold uppercase tracking-wider text-navy-500">
                                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="h-3.5 w-3.5 text-gold-600" fill="none"
                                            stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round"
                                            stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                                            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9" />
                                            <path d="M12 7v5.2l3.2 2" />
                                        </svg>Difficulty</p>
                                    <p class="mt-1.5 text-[14.5px] font-extrabold leading-snug text-navy-900">Easy to
                                        Moderate</p>
                                </div>
                                <div class="rounded-xl border border-navy-900/10 bg-navy-50 px-4 py-3.5">
                                    <p
                                        class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[11px] font-extrabold uppercase tracking-wider text-navy-500">
                                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="h-3.5 w-3.5 text-gold-600" fill="none"
                                            stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round"
                                            stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                                            <path
                                                d="M12 3.5 13.8 9l5.5 1.8-5.5 1.8L12 18.1l-1.8-5.5L4.7 10.8 10.2 9 12 3.5Z" />
                                        </svg>Scoring</p>
                                    <p class="mt-1.5 text-[14.5px] font-extrabold leading-snug text-navy-900">Very High
                                    </p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div id="preparation-tips" class="card mt-5 scroll-mt-28 p-6 sm:p-7">
                            <div class="flex items-center gap-3.5"><span
                                    class="grid h-10 w-10 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-gold-400 font-display text-[16px] font-extrabold text-navy-950">07</span>
                                <h2 class="text-[20px] font-extrabold leading-snug text-navy-900">Preparation Tips for
